    "ch": "chem-11-02",
    "type": "num",
    "diff": 3,
    "q": "In a photoelectric experiment, light of frequency 8.0 x 10^14 Hz ejects electrons with maximum kinetic energy 1.5 eV, and light of frequency 1.2 x 10^15 Hz ejects electrons with maximum kinetic energy 3.3 eV. What is the work function of the metal, in eV? Give your answer to 1 decimal place.",
