    "q": "A polymer sample has 2.0 mol of chains of molar mass 20 000 g/mol and 3.0 mol of chains of molar mass 40 000 g/mol. Find the number average molar mass, in g/mol. Give your answer as a whole number.",
    "ans": 32000.0,
