    "solution": "Expanding along the first row: 2(4 × 6 − 1 × 2) − 1(0 × 6 − 1 × 5) + 3(0 × 2 − 4 × 5) = 2(22) − 1(−5) + 3(−20) = 44 + 5 − 60 = −11. Check: reducing to a triangular form by row operations gives the same value, −11.",
    "sample": false,
