    "type": "mcq",
    "diff": 3,
    "q": "Two lines (x − x₁)/l₁ = (y − y₁)/m₁ = (z − z₁)/n₁ and (x − x₂)/l₂ = (y − y₂)/m₂ = (z − z₂)/n₂ are coplanar if:",
