    "ans": 7.0,
    "decimalPlaces": 0,
    "tol": 0.5,
    "solution": "For one die, E = 3.5. The mean of a sum is the sum of the means, so E(sum) = 3.5 + 3.5 = 7. Check: adding the sums of all 36 equally likely outcomes gives 252, and 252/36 = 7.",
