    "type": "num",
    "diff": 2,
    "q": "Find the gravitational force between a 10 kg mass and a 20 kg mass whose centres are 1.0 m apart, in units of 10⁻⁹ N, to 2 decimal places (G = 6.67 × 10⁻¹¹ N m²/kg²). Give your answer to 2 decimal places.",
    "ans": 13.34,
