    "solution": "g_h = gR²/(R + h)² = 9.8 × (6.4/9.6)² = 9.8 × 0.4444 = 4.356 m/s². Check: the force per unit mass at the distance 9.6 × 10⁶ m, with GM = gR² = 4.014 × 10¹⁴ m³/s², is 4.014 × 10¹⁴/(9.6 × 10⁶)² = 4.356 m/s².",
    "sample": false,
