    "decimalPlaces": 2,
    "tol": 0.005,
    "solution": "The voltage across the resistor is 5.0 − 0.70 = 4.30 V. I = 4.30/430 = 0.0100 A = 10.00 mA. Check: a search for the current at which IR + 0.70 equals 5.0 V gives the same value.",
    "sample": false,
