    "type": "num",
    "diff": 2,
    "q": "Water flows at 2 m/s through a pipe of diameter 4 cm that narrows to a diameter of 2 cm. Find the speed in the narrow part in m/s. Give your answer to 1 decimal place.",
    "ans": 8.0,
