    "ch": "phy-12-02",
    "type": "num",
    "diff": 2,
    "q": "Water (ρ = 1000 kg/m³, viscosity 1.0 × 10⁻³ Pa s) flows at 0.5 m/s through a pipe of diameter 2 cm. Find the Reynolds number. Give your answer as a whole number.",
    "ans": 10000.0,
