    "ch": "phy-12-03",
    "type": "num",
    "diff": 2,
    "q": "A gas of density 1.2 kg/m³ has molecules with an rms speed of 500 m/s. Using kinetic theory, find its pressure in kPa. Give your answer to 1 decimal place.",
