    "ch": "phy-12-03",
    "type": "num",
    "diff": 2,
    "q": "Find the internal energy, in joules, of 2 moles of a monatomic ideal gas at 300 K (R = 8.314 J/(mol K)). Give your answer to 1 decimal place.",
