    "q": "A proton (mass 1.67 × 10⁻²⁷ kg, charge 1.6 × 10⁻¹⁹ C) moves at 3.0 × 10⁶ m/s at right angles to a field of 0.5 T. Find the radius of its circular path in centimetres. Give your answer to 2 decimal places.",
