    "decimalPlaces": 2,
    "tol": 0.005,
    "solution": "I_rms = I₀/√2 = 5.0/1.414 = 3.54 A. Check: the mean of sin² over a cycle is 1/2, so the root of the mean of (5 sin ωt)² is 5/√2.",
